  "method": "File-backed SQLite/WAL, synchronous=FULL. Accelerated world clock. One application write per participant per world second, overwriting the origin on even operations and visiting successive slots on odd operations. Every 5 world seconds drain bounded expiry and retention pages. One hour per rate. Reopen the database and compare all application cell fields and world metadata after each hour.",
